      "message": "I\u0027m not sure whether a `ComputeStep` is always guaranteed to outlive a `ComputePipelineDesc`. A `GraphicsPipelineDesc` only caches a `RenderStep`\u0027s unique ID, which is later used by the backend `ResourceProvider` to look up the `RenderStep` from the shared context\u0027s `RendererProvider`.\n\nI went with this approach because this made it easier define one-off `ComputeStep`s in unit tests. If the lifetime assumption here is wrong, then I can explore a different approach for dependency injection in unit tests (e.g. by defining an overwritable \"lookup callback\" that can by-pass the `RendererProvider` lookup).",
